pedometerhomewidget (0.4.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Maemo Leste port of Pedometer Home Widget 0.3-4, as a C hildon-home
    plugin on a hardware step counter (D-Bus org.pro1x.Steps) instead of
    the accelerometer.

